t":"布局到这边布成五七炮对屏风马。前几局我们都介绍黑方马三进二进马封车的下法，这一局我们介绍黑方马三进四跃马盘河的变化。黑方马三进四的目的是让黑方这一苹二路包比较有选择的权利，或平四或平五。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"红方明车当然。","text":"红方明车当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"我们先看黑方平士角包的变化。","text":"我们先看黑方平士角包的变化。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"红方进车过河。","text":"红方进车过河。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"黑方跳马踩马。","text":"黑方跳马踩马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"红方逼兑。","text":"红方逼兑。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑方进马去炮。再飞象到中路，黑方看起来好像非常平稳。","text":"黑方进马去炮。再飞象到中路，黑方看起来好像非常平稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方开始攻击，第一步棋先进车抓包。","text":"红方开始攻击，第一步棋先进车抓包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"逼黑方支士之後，再进九路兵。","text":"逼黑方支士之後，再进九路兵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"红方的一路车从这里出来是当然之著。","text":"红方的一路车从这里出来是当然之著。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"但红方车九平八之後，由於黑方得左侧被二路车控制住，黑方的一路车暂时在这个位置出路也不是恨畅顺，所以局面到此红方有利。","text":"但红方车九平八之後，由於黑方得左侧被二路车控制住，黑方的一路车暂时在这个位置出路也不是恨畅顺，所以局面到此红方有利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12","raw_text":"我们再回头过来看，当这个局面，我们刚刚介绍黑方平士角包，变化的结果黑方不利，那麽黑方如果反架当头包，它的变化是怎麽样呢？黑方反架当头包，当然它的积极度是受到肯定的。","text":"我们再回头过来看，当这个局面，我们刚刚介绍黑方平士角包，变化的结果黑方不利，那麽黑方如果反架当头包，它的变化是怎麽样呢？黑方反架当头包，当然它的积极度是受到肯定的。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"1:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13","raw_text":"红方仍然进车过河。","text":"红方仍然进车过河。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"1:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14","raw_text":"黑方进马抢中兵。","text":"黑方进马抢中兵。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"1:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17","raw_text":"抢到之後该黑方下。","text":"抢到之後该黑方下。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"1:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"黑方进一路横车。","text":"黑方进一路横车。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19","raw_text":"红方进车巡河，次一著平车抓包。","text":"红方进车巡河，次一著平车抓包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"1:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"如果黑方退包防守，防止红方的平车抓包。","text":"如果黑方退包防守，防止红方的平车抓包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21","raw_text":"红方简单车八平六就占优势了。","text":"红方简单车八平六就占优势了。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"1:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_20","raw_text":"所以黑方退包防守是消极的。如果黑方平车控肋。","text":"所以黑方退包防守是消极的。如果黑方平车控肋。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"2:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_21","raw_text":"红方平车抓包。","text":"红方平车抓包。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"2:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_22","raw_text":"黑方进车保包。","text":"黑方进车保包。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"2:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_23","raw_text":"红方炮七平八，次一著炮八进一打车、轰包是妙棋，逼黑方平车去兵。","text":"红方炮七平八，次一著炮八进一打车、轰包是妙棋，逼黑方平车去兵。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"2:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_24","raw_text":"黑方平车去兵，又要进车去相，对红方有什麽好处呢？","text":"黑方平车去兵，又要进车去相，对红方有什麽好处呢？","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"2:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25","raw_text":"红方平炮到士角，那麽红方的优势在那里呢？","text":"红方平炮到士角，那麽红方的优势在那里呢？","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"2:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_27","raw_text":"当黑方进车去相时。红方退炮好像是不得已之著，但仔细看黑方没办法退车保包，黑方的中路包站不稳，红方就大占优势了。||这盘棋我们学到五七炮攻屏风马右马盘河的方法。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"当黑方进车去相时。红方退炮好像是不得已之著，但仔细看黑方没办法退车保包，黑方的中路包站不稳，红方就大占优势了。\n这盘棋我们学到五七炮攻屏风马右马盘河的方法。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"2:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["3.五七炮攻屏风马右马盘河局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第1节 五七炮攻击篇 第二章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":33,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":3,"structured_branches":2,"line_statuses":{"legal":3},"source_move_records":43,"legal_move_records":43,"annotations":26,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":26}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-65","category_id":"65","title":"第二章 当头炮攻屏风马 第1节 五七炮攻击篇 3.五七炮攻屏风马右马盘河局","catalogue_order":34,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-65-2.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-65"]}}
